    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Mountain Stack FAQ Manager is a modern, lightweight WordPress plugin that helps you create, organize, and display professional FAQ sections without writing code.</p>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re building product FAQs, documentation, help centers, or support pages, the plugin delivers a fast, responsive experience while improving your site&#8217;s SEO with automatic FAQ schema markup.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Modern Gutenberg block with live preview</li>\n<li>Responsive accordion layout</li>\n<li>Instant client-side FAQ search</li>\n<li>Automatic FAQPage JSON-LD schema</li>\n<li>Organize FAQs using categories</li>\n<li>Shortcode support</li>\n<li>Theme template override support</li>\n<li>REST API for headless WordPress</li>\n<li>Fast, lightweight, and developer-friendly</li>\n<li>Clean, accessible, and responsive design</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Perfect For</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Business websites</li>\n<li>WooCommerce stores</li>\n<li>Product documentation</li>\n<li>Help centers</li>\n<li>Knowledge bases</li>\n<li>Service providers</li>\n<li>Agencies</li>\n<li>SaaS websites</li>\n<li>Blogs and publishers</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Why Choose Mountain Stack FAQ Manager?</h3>\n<p>Unlike many FAQ plugins, Mountain Stack FAQ Manager focuses on performance, clean code, SEO, and flexibility. It works seamlessly with modern WordPress themes and the Block Editor while remaining easy to use and highly customizable.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>mountain-stack-faq-manager</code> folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin from the Plugins screen.</li>\n<li>Open <strong>Mountain Stack FAQ Manager</strong> from the WordPress admin menu.</li>\n<li>Create FAQ categories and FAQs.</li>\n<li>Display FAQs using the Gutenberg block or the <code>[quickfaq category=\"general\"]</code> shortcode.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"how%20do%20i%20display%20faqs%3F\">\nHow do I display FAQs?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Use the Mountain Stack FAQ Manager Gutenberg block or the shortcode:</p>\n<pre><code>[quickfaq category=\"shipping\"]\n</code></pre>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"can%20i%20customize%20the%20output%3F\">\nCan I customize the output?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. Copy the template files from <code>templates/</code> into your active theme&#8217;s <code>quickfaq</code> folder and customize them without modifying the plugin.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"does%20the%20plugin%20generate%20faq%20schema%3F\">\nDoes the plugin generate FAQ schema?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. FAQPage JSON-LD schema is generated automatically to help search engines better understand your FAQ content.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improved security for JSON-LD output.</li>\n<li>Enhanced REST API permissions.</li>\n<li>Updated plugin display name to Mountain Stack FAQ Manager.</li>\n<li>Minor improvements and bug fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Build beautiful, SEO-friendly FAQ sections with Gutenberg blocks, shortcodes, live search, FAQ schema, and REST API support.",
    "description": "<p>Mountain Stack FAQ Manager is a modern, lightweight WordPress plugin that helps you create, organize, and display professional FAQ sections without writing code.</p>\n<p>Whether you&#8217;re building product FAQs, documentation, help centers, or support pages, the plugin delivers a fast, responsive experience while improving your site&#8217;s SEO with automatic FAQ schema markup.</p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Modern Gutenberg block with live preview</li>\n<li>Responsive accordion layout</li>\n<li>Instant client-side FAQ search</li>\n<li>Automatic FAQPage JSON-LD schema</li>\n<li>Organize FAQs using categories</li>\n<li>Shortcode support</li>\n<li>Theme template override support</li>\n<li>REST API for headless WordPress</li>\n<li>Fast, lightweight, and developer-friendly</li>\n<li>Clean, accessible, and responsive design</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Perfect For</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Business websites</li>\n<li>WooCommerce stores</li>\n<li>Product documentation</li>\n<li>Help centers</li>\n<li>Knowledge bases</li>\n<li>Service providers</li>\n<li>Agencies</li>\n<li>SaaS websites</li>\n<li>Blogs and publishers</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Why Choose Mountain Stack FAQ Manager?</h3>\n<p>Unlike many FAQ plugins, Mountain Stack FAQ Manager focuses on performance, clean code, SEO, and flexibility. It works seamlessly with modern WordPress themes and the Block Editor while remaining easy to use and highly customizable.</p>\n",
